  "spec_section": "markdown-dialect.md §3 (footnotes)",
  "description": "Pins the Myne dialect footnote parser (src/dialect/lezer/footnote.ts) — which byte ranges are recognized as FootnoteDefinition / FootnoteReference / FootnoteLabel / FootnoteMark. Offsets are UTF-8 byte offsets. recognize cases carry the recognized spans (pre-order); inert cases carry an empty span list (a near-miss the parser must NOT recognize). TS-runner category (no Rust generator).",
